<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109329" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποτᾰράσσω</span></b> , 
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποτακ-θράσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποτάκ-ττω</span></b> :—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stir up, trouble,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				1285
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Fab.</u>
				2
			</span></i>, etc.:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοιλίη . . ὑπεταράχθη</span>
			f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				1.26
			</span></i>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έ; ὑ. πρός τι</span>
			<i>to be somewhat troubled</i> at . . , <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMort.</u>
				7.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τι</span>
			<i>cause</i> some <i>trouble,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				39.56
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				79.4
			</span></i>.</div>
